<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-28T08:12:30.398Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:12:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security officials met in Jammu to review anti-infiltration measures while Manipur forces buried seven Kuki civilians killed by militants after two months, and the BSF Raising Day parade was relocated to Delhi over security concerns. China and India held fresh border talks and both sides increased military readiness before winter. A bear attack injured five people in Udhampur and a leopard injured a seven-year-old boy in Kupwara shortly after a fatal leopard attack in the same district. Four family members were killed and a minor girl injured in a road accident in Baramulla. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3376066/china-and-india-hold-fresh-border-talks-both-boost-military-readiness-winter&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNYkNvRExDWFYtcEptNUxucE1USzhaV0FrSlRKSkd0UEk2SWxIWHRJVk0wNmNyWkJFaElDTlBiY1pfMW4yNV90UE5BWms4THc5anpxSjNGSnl3a3A1bDZaTkd5WmZrcWJHd2hjcnZYUzl0d0VTeDM2MXZRY2hWTi01WFZ4dE1BU2NJZ2EtSjVET1EyQUphM0pnR0toRVdjNjFmX0ZEcGMwcmZ3NDZVMjNaV0NHVUdrVjc3U19r?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNQnJzZXh5MlFFYWlRcFE5MDVQblhwdGlsOGw1aGduMVpLYUFVTDB3QTNVS1hVRlZncjBVemZrTW9VYXU1MEM2YVUxMW1DU1J3d3B1QWotY3BDaHByelhxTEZqSkZJcUY3c0NxS1NvMGg0STN0XzZrWkw1WEFZc3ZRUXh1ZWFvdDFBQ0x0YVJGWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/ar